    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Tx is conservative, usually only a beta-blocker (eg, propranolol) in the hyperthyroid phase; antithyroid drugs, surgery and RAI are contraindicated."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
